usage: feather [-h] [--config CONFIG] [--model MODEL] [--base-url BASE_URL]
               [--workdir WORKSPACE] [--max-turns MAX_TURNS] [--python PYTHON]
               [--profile {train,prod}]
               prompt

Run Feather on one task in a local workspace.

positional arguments:
  prompt                Task instructions; use '-' to read them from stdin.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG       JSON configuration file.
  --model MODEL         Model identifier at the Chat Completions endpoint.
  --base-url BASE_URL   OpenAI-compatible API base URL, including /v1 when
                        needed.
  --workdir WORKSPACE   Existing workspace directory (default: current
                        directory).
  --max-turns MAX_TURNS
                        Maximum agent turns (default: 100).
  --python PYTHON       Python executable for task shell commands; Feather
                        keeps its own runtime.
  --profile {train,prod}
                        Startup profile (default: prod).
